Historical flavor events for Poland, from 1936 up to the German invasion. Each event is drawn from a sourced moment of the period, from politics and sport to culture, the army and the sea. Most show a photograph; the rest use the game's own event art. The events leave vanilla Poland's own focuses and events alone.

